# Tiptap editor (campaign posts)

Use [Tiptap](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/getting-started/overview) — not Editor.js.

- Admin editor: `@tiptap/react` + `useEditor` + `EditorContent` + `StarterKit` + `Image` + `Link`
- Store content as ProseMirror JSON (`{ type: "doc", content: [...] }`) in the `content` json column
- Storefront render: `@tiptap/html` `generateHTML()` with the same extensions as admin
- Empty content fallback: `EMPTY_TIPTAP_DOC` from `tiptap-editor/extensions.ts`
- Image upload: Medusa `sdk.client.fetch("/admin/uploads")` then `editor.chain().focus().setImage({ src })`
- Keep toolbar visible (Bold, Italic, H2, H3, lists, image) — do not rely on hidden block toolboxes
- Stop event propagation on editor wrapper inside `<form>` (keydown/mousedown)
